//! Graphic sets from the catalog (`docs/GRAPHICS-CATALOG.md`, `docs/graphics-catalog.csv`).
//!
//! OWNERSHIP: everything under `src/gfx/sets/` is built by a separate agent (Codex) following
//! `docs/CODEX-GRAPHICS-BRIEF.md`. Other agents do not edit this folder, and the sets agent does
//! not edit files outside it. The app reaches this module through exactly three hooks, all
//! already wired:
//!
//! - [`TEMPLATES`] + [`build`]: listed in Graphics Studio with the built-in templates
//!   (`templates::all`) and built by `templates::build_classic` when no built-in key matches.
//! - [`bind`]: extra `{{bindings}}` for these sets, called from `bind_ext::extend` after the
//!   built-in bindings (so it may add keys, never needs to change existing ones).
//! - [`draw_map`]: county / state maps for `Layer::risk_map` specs starting with `set:`
//!   (called from `riskmap::draw`).
//! - [`refresh`]: fetch the data these sets need (every 15 minutes, with the hazard feeds,
//!   on a background task). Keep what it fetches in this module's own store.
//!
//! Shared building blocks (read-only for this module): `templates::{text, caps, wrapped,
//! shadowed, header, footer, panel, bg_gradient, DISPLAY, BODY}`, `model::{GraphicDoc, Layer,
//! LayerKind, Fill, AnimKind}`, the TWC palette in `crate::twc`, county outlines in
//! `crate::map::boundaries`, places in `crate::places`.

